<Layouts.app flash={@flash} current_scope={@current_scope} wide>
  <header class="mb-10 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-5 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
    <.link
      navigate={~p"/cameras"}
      class="flex items-center gap-3"
      aria-label="Sentinel · Cámaras"
    >
      <span class="flex size-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-teal-400/10 text-teal-300 ring-1 ring-teal-300/20">
        <.icon name="hero-viewfinder-circle" class="size-7" />
      </span>
      <span>
        <span class="block text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Sentinel</span>
        <span class="block text-xs tracking-wide text-slate-400">MONITOREO DE SUCURSALES</span>
      </span>
    </.link>
    <span class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-400">
      División &amp; La Virgen
    </span>
    <.link
      :if={@visitor_access?}
      id="visitor-history"
      href={~p"/visitors"}
      class="rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-sm text-teal-300 transition hover:bg-teal-300/10"
    >Historial de cruces</.link>
  </header>

  <section aria-labelledby="camera-heading">
    <div class="mb-7 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-teal-300">
          Tu espacio de observación
        </p>
        <h1 id="camera-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
          Cámaras
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-400">
          Elige qué ver. Comienza en calidad secundaria y ajusta cada cámara cuando necesites más detalle.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span id="camera-count" aria-live="polite" class="text-sm tabular-nums text-slate-400">
          <span class="font-semibold text-white">{@camera_count}</span> / 8 seleccionadas
        </span>
        <button
          id="clear-cameras"
          type="button"
          phx-click="clear"
          disabled={@camera_count == 0}
          class="rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-300 transition hover:bg-white/10 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-teal-300 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-30"
        >
          Limpiar todo
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <.form
      for={@form}
      id="camera-selection-form"
      phx-submit="add"
      class="mb-8 flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900/70 p-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:p-5"
    >
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-slate-200 [&_label]:text-slate-300">
        <.input
          field={@form[:camera_id]}
          id="camera-select"
          type="select"
          label="Sucursal y cámara"
          prompt="Selecciona una cámara…"
          options={@camera_options}
          required
          class="mt-2 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate-100 outline-none transition focus:border-teal-300 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-300/20"
        />
      </div>
      <button
        id="add-camera"
        type="submit"
        disabled={@camera_count >= 8}
        phx-disable-with="Agregando…"
        class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-teal-300 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-teal-200 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-4 focus-visible:outline-teal-300 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40"
      >
        <.icon name="hero-plus-small" class="size-5" /> Agregar cámara
      </button>
    </.form>

    <div
      id="camera-grid"
      phx-update="stream"
      class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 2xl:grid-cols-3"
    >
      <div
        id="camera-empty"
        class="col-span-full hidden min-h-80 flex-col items-center justify-center rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-slate-700 px-6 py-16 text-center only:flex"
      >
        <span class="mb-5 flex size-16 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-slate-500 ring-1 ring-white/10">
          <.icon name="hero-video-camera" class="size-8" />
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-medium text-slate-200">Una vista a tu medida</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 max-w-sm text-sm leading-6 text-slate-500">
          Agrega una cámara de cualquier sucursal para comenzar. Puedes combinar hasta ocho en esta cuadrícula.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article
        :for={{dom_id, camera} <- @streams.cameras}
        id={dom_id}
        class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-900 shadow-lg shadow-black/10"
      >
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-4">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs text-teal-300">{camera.branch}</p>
            <h2 class="mt-0.5 text-sm font-semibold">{camera.label}</h2>
          </div>
          <button
            id={"remove-#{camera.id}"}
            type="button"
            phx-click="remove"
            phx-value-id={camera.id}
            aria-label={"Quitar #{camera.label} de #{camera.branch}"}
            class="rounded-lg p-2 text-slate-500 transition hover:bg-white/10 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-teal-300"
          >
            <.icon name="hero-x-mark" class="size-5" />
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div
            id={"player-#{camera.id}-#{camera.quality}-#{camera.generation}"}
            phx-hook="HlsPlayer"
            phx-update="ignore"
            data-source={camera.url}
            data-status-url={
              if(camera.engine != "off",
                do: "/hls/#{camera.id}/#{camera.quality}/#{camera.engine}/status"
              )
            }
            class="relative aspect-video bg-black"
          >
            <span
              :if={camera.engine != "off"}
              data-detection-status
              class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-12 left-3 z-10 rounded-md bg-black/75 px-2 py-1 text-xs text-teal-200"
            >Preparando detector…</span>
            <video
              id={"video-#{camera.id}-#{camera.quality}-#{camera.generation}"}
              aria-label={"#{camera.branch} · #{camera.label} · #{camera.quality}"}
              autoplay
              muted
              playsinline
              controls
              class="h-full w-full"
            ></video>
            <p
              data-player-status
              role="status"
              aria-live="polite"
              class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-3 top-3 rounded-lg bg-black/70 px-3 py-2 text-xs text-slate-200"
            >
              Conectando con la cámara…
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            :if={camera.counting_form}
            id={"calibration-#{camera.id}-#{camera.quality}-#{camera.generation}"}
            phx-hook="CountingLine"
            phx-update="ignore"
            data-camera-id={camera.id}
            data-video-id={"video-#{camera.id}-#{camera.quality}-#{camera.generation}"}
            data-x1={camera.counting_rule.x1}
            data-y1={camera.counting_rule.y1}
            data-x2={camera.counting_rule.x2}
            data-y2={camera.counting_rule.y2}
            class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"
            aria-label="Calibración de línea de conteo"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3 px-4 py-3">
          <.form
            for={camera.form}
            id={"quality-#{camera.id}"}
            phx-change="quality"
            phx-value-id={camera.id}
            class="text-slate-300 [&_label]:text-slate-400"
          >
            <.input
              field={camera.form[:value]}
              id={"quality-select-#{camera.id}"}
              type="select"
              label="Calidad"
              options={[
                {"Secundaria · menor consumo", "secundaria"},
                {"Principal · más detalle", "principal"}
              ]}
              class="mt-1 block max-w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-2 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-teal-300"
            />
          </.form>
          <.form
            for={camera.detection_form}
            id={"detection-#{camera.id}"}
            phx-change="engine"
            phx-value-id={camera.id}
          >
            <.input
              field={camera.detection_form[:engine]}
              id={"engine-#{camera.id}"}
              type="select"
              label="Personas y autos"
              options={[
                {"Desactivado", "off"},
                {"Python · YOLO", "python"},
                {"Elixir · ONNX", "elixir"}
              ]}
              class="mt-1 block max-w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-2 py-1.5 text-xs text-slate-200 outline-none focus:border-teal-300"
            />
          </.form>
          <button
            id={"retry-#{camera.id}"}
            type="button"
            phx-click="retry"
            phx-value-id={camera.id}
            aria-label={"Reintentar #{camera.label} de #{camera.branch}"}
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-2 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400 transition hover:bg-white/5 hover:text-teal-300 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-teal-300"
          >
            <.icon name="hero-arrow-path" class="size-4" /> Reintentar
          </button>
        </div>
        <div :if={@visitor_access?} class="border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-4">
          <.live_component
            module={CountingStatusComponent}
            id={"counting-indicators-#{camera.id}"}
            camera_id={camera.id}
          />
          <button
            id={"configure-counting-#{camera.id}"}
            phx-click="configure-counting"
            phx-value-id={camera.id}
            class="rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-teal-300 transition hover:bg-teal-300/10"
          >Configurar conteo de cruces</button>
          <.form
            :if={camera.counting_form}
            for={camera.counting_form}
            id={"counting-rule-#{camera.id}"}
            phx-change="validate-counting"
            phx-submit="save-counting"
            phx-value-id={camera.id}
            class="mt-4 space-y-4"
          >
            <p class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">
              Dibuja una línea sobre el video, arrastra sus extremos o mueve la línea completa. Las coordenadas van de 0 a 1. También puedes ajustarlas aquí.
            </p>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
              <.input
                :for={field <- [:x1, :y1, :x2, :y2]}
                field={camera.counting_form[field]}
                type="number"
                label={String.upcase(to_string(field))}
                min="0"
                max="1"
                step="0.001"
                class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100"
              />
            </div>
            <.input
              field={camera.counting_form[:engine]}
              type="select"
              label="Motor del contador"
              options={[{"Python · YOLO", "python"}, {"Elixir · ONNX", "elixir"}]}
              class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100"
            />
            <.input
              field={camera.counting_form[:entry_direction]}
              type="select"
              label="Dirección de entrada"
              options={[{"Lado positivo", "positive"}, {"Lado negativo", "negative"}]}
              class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100"
            />
            <p class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">
              La línea va del extremo verde al amarillo. Para una línea horizontal de izquierda a derecha, el lado positivo queda abajo. Confirma el sentido con un cruce de prueba.
            </p>
            <.input
              field={camera.counting_form[:confidence]}
              type="number"
              label="Confianza mínima"
              min="0.35"
              max="1"
              step="0.01"
              class="mt-1 block w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-700 bg-slate-950 px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-100"
            />
            <.input
              field={camera.counting_form[:enabled]}
              type="checkbox"
              label="Habilitar conteo continuo"
              class="size-4 rounded border-slate-600 accent-teal-300"
            />
            <p class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-400">
              Cuenta cruces, no personas únicas. Continúa sin espectadores y usa su propio motor. Cambiar el motor del reproductor no cambia el conteo.
            </p>
            <button
              id={"save-counting-#{camera.id}"}
              class="rounded-lg bg-teal-300 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-teal-200"
              phx-disable-with="Guardando…"
            >Guardar regla</button>
            <button
              id={"close-counting-#{camera.id}"}
              type="button"
              phx-click="close-counting"
              phx-value-id={camera.id}
              class="ml-2 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-400 transition hover:text-white"
            >Cerrar calibración</button>
          </.form>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">
      La reproducción puede tener varios segundos de retraso. El estado de conexión aparece sobre cada video.
      La selección se conserva mientras permanezcas en esta página.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layouts.app>
